#: scenario5:scenario5_A1A925CB_1079_4097_9984_F74FFA5128D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a1657c606b807e80efa368243287b28422f0be385384aa1765be1e8c645f75f
#. default-sha256: 575ea4e183cf2b68787ce91b27b0cb6aff5ae8fe70e9615fba0f91028740a752
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A1A925CB_1079_4097_9984_F74FFA5128D7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For far longer than was comfortable, the only sound we heard was the gentle crackling of the "
"fire."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫二人彼此保持了长时间的沉默，⟪k:1⟫屋里唯一能听见的，⟪k:2⟫是暖炉里劈啪作响的火花声。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2FC207D4_5BB8_4F13_8ED3_B5CC837D3D60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 00a7f92e8caf27b290cd67a052c5de306f330a8a2b2aefd14840551a51d20e66
#. default-sha256: d4dab17294ca2c5a70abe634004c384b6267c509c58386a38d82abaf185b4521
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2FC207D4_5BB8_4F13_8ED3_B5CC837D3D60"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had to say something.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I knew that, but what I didn’t know was how to begin."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……我必须主动开口。⟪k:1⟫但究竟该说些什么才好？⟪k:2⟫又该用何等措辞才妥？⟪k:3⟫完全没有头绪。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7636C76B_F264_44A8_B5FB_DAF40CA9AC9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f5bec23e0b0390e424d8328d17f9b065b3dd0be7f04b3780c8e20df817d5ddc
#. default-sha256: 02a2bf477a327e37844c483e433ad9bef4401006957e8f6497c918a76fe0d705
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7636C76B_F264_44A8_B5FB_DAF40CA9AC9B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I knew nothing about having an honest, face-to-face discussion with someone about the things "
"we were thinking and feeling."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我不懂该如何与人面对面交谈，⟪k:1⟫不懂得如何体会彼此的感情，⟪k:2⟫更不懂得如何互诉衷肠。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_4CA04C0A_498A_4B14_8295_73157439C193
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cba6754c65834aa6bf1cb52e10054624dd7b3729f603ce58dbbff0c0efb4aa54
#. default-sha256: e77bb0e9ec84d28eaba9a4d77d82f1f1501adf9917f1c71264535fde0b9064a2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4CA04C0A_498A_4B14_8295_73157439C193"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But that didn’t change anything..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫尽管如此……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_4CB3629A_C22C_48AF_B79D_4760DD361590
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 978929ecbc571426ea86fff2468264744e06ff931fd27eee893dabec2fc9e580
