msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3E162B84_873A_4674_91CC_E3B88D707B3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b285a0591791b0561596e88b4877f5fd6f828cace65a02091ff3f5efca9d7a6
#. default-sha256: a9c3d18bfaf1ca8b90f4352b88d3339df7f0a940aad318a699d69f6768b668d8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3E162B84_873A_4674_91CC_E3B88D707B3F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Could you please tell me... ⟪k:3⟫what you did at—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫no, what was done "
"to you at my family’s home,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫能……告诉我吗？⟪k:3⟫你在我家到底——⟪k:4⟫不，⟪k:5⟫是我家到底对你做了什么……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9C3B4E45_04D7_436C_93E2_3859E3D15729
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8f1e486016c8178b32ffb590d1c47fd5db7e0c1bab836b85bab58f4f9f3e768
#. default-sha256: b53c0c04e2c8117771a32b18a0117ee57b316d02e19337e43a9e63fd73d34f32
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9C3B4E45_04D7_436C_93E2_3859E3D15729"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫how you ended up coming to this mansion,⟪k:1⟫and what happened after you left?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫还有……为何你会来到我这里。⟪k:1⟫离开馆的那段时间又发生了什么……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9DE87E9A_C5CB_4993_AD68_3A37ED68FDA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 81707ac70d2ce54c8f023687d200ef2211394dea11ef9370434ab102b8a1c437
