msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You never so much... ⟪k:2⟫as gave me the time of day before."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫明明至今……⟪k:2⟫一次都不愿听我解释？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E584FF28_B9B3_445B_98B1_EEEF908B5811
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 24ee7b21d4b79dae411d4d35c5d34b6d3623cf7aa40627c944a5f9a5f63c7360
